{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b1a2c3d4-5678-4abc-9def-shrink0000001",
    "name": "Schedula Shrinking API Tests",
    "description": "PATCH /doctor/availability/:id/shrink. Run Collection Runner top to bottom.\n\nSignup emails are unique per runId. Variables match schedula-full-api-tests naming (doctorToken, patientToken, doctorId, availabilityId, expandDate).\n\nCovers: auto-reassign, RESCHEDULE_NEEDED, empty shrink, invalid bounds (400), missing id (404), patient (403), no token (401).",
